@startuml
title Decorator and Facade
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
interface Exercise
class HintDecorator {
-exercise: Exercise
+id()
+view()
+checkAnswer(answer)
}
class FeedbackDecorator {
-exercise: Exercise
+id()
+view()
+checkAnswer(answer)
}
Exercise <|.. HintDecorator
Exercise <|.. FeedbackDecorator
HintDecorator o-- Exercise : wraps
FeedbackDecorator o-- Exercise : wraps
class LessonFacade {
+submitAnswer(answer): AnswerResult
+nextExercise()
+isComplete(): boolean
+progress(): ProgressSnapshot
}
class LessonSessionPanel
class ReviewSession
class ProgressTracker
class Lesson
LessonSessionPanel --> LessonFacade : calls
LessonFacade --> Lesson : holds
LessonFacade ..> ReviewSession : orders at construction
LessonFacade --> Exercise : checks current
LessonFacade --> ProgressTracker : records answer
@enduml
